# Files whose exact committed bytes are hashed, signed or compared across
# Windows and Linux CI (packaging/package.py, packaging/cargo-notices.py,
# packaging/windows-signing, packaging/release_assets.py). Git never converts
# their line endings, whatever core.autocrlf says. Deliberately narrow: all
# other files keep Git's default behaviour.
/apps/desktop/src/ui/icons/** -text
/apps/desktop/src/ui/fonts/** -text
/apps/desktop/assets/** -text
/packaging/*.ps1 -text
/packaging/third-party-licenses/** -text
